  "ret": "List[(Int, Int)]",
  "desc": "Return (value, count) pairs for the k most frequent distinct values of xs, ordered by count from highest to lowest; values with equal counts are ordered from smallest to largest value. If k exceeds the number of distinct values, return all of them; if k <= 0, return an empty list.",
